# Pairs with ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler (R -> C, #5839): a read-only cold load never lowers a
# generation a claim raised, so no straddler of the purged incarnation is admitted after reinit.
MODULE: ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddlerLowersReclaimed
TARGET: ColdLoadMeetsCoreStraddler
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the cold load installs the floor whatever the durable row holds, lowering the generation the re-created incarnation's first claim raised, so a straddler is admitted after reinit

--- FIND
    /\ memFence' = [memFence EXCEPT ![i] = Max2(fence[i], retired[i])]
--- REPLACE
    /\ memFence' = [memFence EXCEPT ![i] = retired[i]]
--- END
